<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RoleRelationship> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "RoleRelationship represents a relationship between an entity holding a role and the scope or context in which that role applies. The givenRole property specifies the role assigned."@en .
_:N2d95a849094f46f59300152b49574203 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType/describes> .
