<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/givenRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "givenRole is a property that specifies the role being assigned in a RoleRelationship. It links the relationship to an instance of the Role class, defining the function, responsibility, or position that the source element confers upon the target element."@en .
